{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NSFW expansion themed potion crafting puzzle game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After selling health potions to dungeon-delving adventurers, the dungeon\u2019s dark overlord is none-too-happy with you. Now she is forcing you to sell sabotaged potions, custom brewed with for each adventurer to hinder them with kinky bodily transformations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, warriors get the breast expansion potion, UNLESS they intend to fight eyeball-demons (who are easily distracted, but can you blame them?), but don\u2019t bother if you\u2019ve already given them the blueberry potion, which swells them up so big that they roll over and squish the adventurers preceding them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the adventurers are too bold, stupid, or horny to be dissuaded, you might be able to use some cursed artifacts to deal with them. The Skimpy Bra of Invincibility probably won\u2019t help you, but the Bimbonomicon might. If all else fails, the local monsters might have some ways to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Potion Please is a lighthearted, comedic, potion crafting point-and-click-adventure game revolving around kink elements. Includes: <br><strong>-Breast Expansion</strong>,  <br>-<strong>Ass Expansion,\u00a0</strong> <br><strong>-Thigh Expansion,\u00a0</strong> <br><strong>-Belly Expansion, </strong> <br><strong>-Lip Expansion</strong>,<strong> </strong> <br><strong>-Lactation,  </strong> <br><strong>-Bimbofication,  </strong> <br><strong>-Shortstackification,  </strong> <br><strong>-and other kinky transformations!\u00a0 </strong> <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fantastic artwork by <strong>DrWahee!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hyper sizes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Linear story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-No explicit sex scenes. Partial nudity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The first 21 days/levels of content<br>-Temporary artwork <br>-A PARTIAL Endless mode, and a PARTIAL Sandbox mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is likely to be updated as progress on the full game continues.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942560?t=1759021096","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942560/3c99ca65ca4b8c11dc273282f4e6024e94d689eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759021096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942560/ac2a75f0cf8ea54ed263f3a05088827cbc3a1b9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759021096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942560/ac2a75f0cf8ea54ed263f3a05088827cbc3a1b9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759021096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"NSFW game revolves around fetish based transformations. Features many naked breasts, but no full frontal nudity, and no explicit sex scenes. Includes breast expansion, hyper sizes, butt expansion, lip expansion, shortstackification, bimbofication, blueberry, and other fetishes of similar severity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NSFW expansion themed potion crafting puzzle game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After selling health potions to dungeon-delving adventurers, the dungeon\u2019s dark overlord is none-too-happy with you. Now she is forcing you to sell sabotaged potions, custom brewed with for each adventurer to hinder them with kinky bodily transform